# Security supplement integration and handoff

This English reference follows the security design supplement 0.1, dated 2026-10-08. The [Chinese export](../安全专项/整合说明.md) and its [provenance](../安全专项/整合说明.provenance.json) preserve the original wording and hashes. Apply the supplement through the existing Technical and Selfcheck modules and use actual project decisions for phase confirmation.

## 1. Use the security references

| Reference | When to read | Output |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [Security SOP](security-sop.md) | Draft, refine, or review security design | Boundaries, procedure, design depth, evidence levels, and prerequisites for actual execution |
| Locale-matched security design template | Record or complete a particular project's design | AST/TB/DF, TH, CTRL, technical and task links, ST and evidence, questions, and issues |
